### Buscar conta
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/1001

### Buscar extrato
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/1001/statement

### Transferencia com chave de idempotencia
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: treino-001

{
  "sourceAccountId": 1001,
  "targetAccountId": 1002,
  "amount": 50.00
}

### Repetir a mesma transferencia deve retornar replayed=true
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: treino-001

{
  "sourceAccountId": 1001,
  "targetAccountId": 1002,
  "amount": 50.00
}

### Reutilizar a chave com outro payload deve retornar 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: treino-001

{
  "sourceAccountId": 1001,
  "targetAccountId": 1003,
  "amount": 75.00
}
